{"ID":"20240118145012-om26vz6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145012-om26vz6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145012-om26vz6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162050-dmyu4sa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162335-8tczoup\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:771,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162204-5lqjicm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:37\u0026#125;","title":"323古南324黄环325溲疏326鼠李327药实根328栾花329蔓椒330豚卵331麋脂332鼯鼠333六畜毛蹄甲334虾蟆335马刀","type":"doc","updated":"20240204145120"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240122162050-dmyu4sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162050-dmyu4sa","updated":"20240122162053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"古南"}]},{"ID":"20240118145012-lzpbov3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145012-lzpbov3","updated":"20240122162110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二三、古南【本经原文】一名鬼目。味辛，平，有毒。主养肾气，内伤阴衰，利筋骨皮毛。实，杀虫毒，破积聚，逐风痹。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162054-qic6f2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162054-qic6f2z","updated":"20240122162100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄环"}]},{"ID":"20240122162101-cnjpi5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162101-cnjpi5j","updated":"20240122162108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二四、黄环【本经原文】一名凌泉，一名大就。味苦，平，有毒。治蛊毒，鬼疰，鬼魅，邪气在臓中，除咳逆，寒热。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162111-8b6a09c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162111-8b6a09c","updated":"20240122162115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"溲疏"}]},{"ID":"20240122162116-nuz1f3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162116-nuz1f3h","updated":"20240122162120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二五、溲疏【本经原文】味辛，寒，无毒。治身皮肤中热，除邪气，止遗溺。生川谷及田野故丘墟地。可作浴汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162120-53v1bxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162120-53v1bxo","updated":"20240122162125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鼠李"}]},{"ID":"20240122162126-bjy6w30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162126-bjy6w30","updated":"20240122162130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二六、鼠李【本经原文】治寒热，瘰疬疮。生田野。今少用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162131-f1pnluu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162131-f1pnluu","updated":"20240122162137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药实根"}]},{"ID":"20240122162137-1bp2am3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162137-1bp2am3","updated":"20240122162141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二七、药实根【本经原文】一名连木。味辛，温，无毒。治邪气，诸痹疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162141-ppucp5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162141-ppucp5r","updated":"20240122162146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栾花"}]},{"ID":"20240122162146-b7ieszm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162146-b7ieszm","updated":"20240122162159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二八、栾花【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治目痛，泪出，伤眦，消目肿。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162200-9q396yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162200-9q396yf","updated":"20240122162204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蔓椒"}]},{"ID":"20240122162204-5lqjicm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162204-5lqjicm","updated":"20240122162209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三二九、蔓椒【本经原文】味苦，温，无毒。治风寒湿痹歴节疼，除四肢厥气，膝痛。生川谷及丘冢间。一名豕椒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162209-lb80xh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162209-lb80xh0","updated":"20240122162215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"豚卵"}]},{"ID":"20240122162216-fic6avq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162216-fic6avq","updated":"20240122162220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三三〇、豚卵【本经原文】味甘，温，无毒。治惊痫，癫疾，鬼疰，虫毒，除寒热，奔豚，五癃，邪气，挛缩。悬蹄，平。主五痔，伏热在肠，肠痈内蚀。一名豚颠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162220-ueqgagn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162220-ueqgagn","updated":"20240122162233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"麋脂"}]},{"ID":"20240122162234-ygawf9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162234-ygawf9u","updated":"20240122162236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三三一、麋脂【本经原文】味辛，温，无毒。治痈肿，恶疮，死肌，风寒湿痹，四肢拘缓不收，风头肿，气通腠理。生山谷及淮海边。一名官脂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162236-zn9wb2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162236-zn9wb2l","updated":"20240122162247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鼯鼠"}]},{"ID":"20240122162248-3ago5f5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162248-3ago5f5","updated":"20240122162252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三三二、（鼯）鼠【本经原文】微温。主堕胎，令产易。生平谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162253-slb4fh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162253-slb4fh0","updated":"20240122162300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"六畜毛蹄甲"}]},{"ID":"20240122162304-xe4s12e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162304-xe4s12e","updated":"20240122162305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三三三、六畜毛蹄甲【本经原文】味咸，平，有毒。治鬼疰，虫毒，寒热，惊痫，癫，痉，狂走。骆驼毛，尤良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162305-hn438bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162305-hn438bc","updated":"20240122162308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"虾蟆"}]},{"ID":"20240122162311-vm1knq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162311-vm1knq3","updated":"20240122162316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三三四、虾蟆【本经原文】味辛，寒，有毒。治邪气，破症坚血，痈肿，阴疮，服之不患热病。生江湖池泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162316-g5jzulf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162316-g5jzulf","updated":"20240122162321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"马刀"}]},{"ID":"20240122162322-b8xwc4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162322-b8xwc4x","updated":"20240122162326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三三五、马刀【本经原文】味辛，微寒，有毒。治漏下赤白，寒热，破石淋，杀禽兽，贼鼠。生江湖池泽及东海。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162327-zin0dqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162327-zin0dqf"}},{"ID":"20240122162335-zfcz49i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162335-zfcz49i"}},{"ID":"20240122162335-b5pznk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162335-b5pznk0"}},{"ID":"20240122162335-8tczoup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162335-8tczoup","updated":"20240204145120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从336后面开始有，我们开始有使用它哦，那在《神农本草经》呢，一直要到页，到了357这个麋脂的时候，这个《神农本草经》最后一味，后面我把它加进去的就是，在本草经里面没有列进去，列进去，我把他附进去，特别去说明的，在《伤寒》《金匮》里面有出现的药，我把它补在后面，这样子的话，你看经方会看得比较完整一点。"}]}]}